@startuml Normal Build Flow (Simplified)

title Normal Build Flow

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F4F8
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderThickness 1
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #999999
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left

actor       "User"               as U
participant "Web Frontend"       as FE
participant "Backend API"        as BE
participant "Automation Worker"  as W
participant "Proxmox Hypervisor" as PX

== Submission ==

U  -> FE : Configure scenario
FE -> BE : POST /api/builds
BE --> FE : requestId (state=QUEUED)

== Claiming ==

W  -> BE : Poll: claim job
BE --> W  : Build spec (state=BUILDING)

== Provisioning & Script Execution ==

W  -> PX : Clone template, start VM, wait for SSH
W  -> PX : Execute vulnerability scripts (SSH)
W  -> BE : Derive flags
BE --> W  : Raw flags
W  -> PX : Place flags, sanitise, shut down VM

== Export ==

W  -> BE : progress (state=EXPORTING)
W  -> PX : Export OVA (SSH), transfer to worker
W  -> W  : Compute OVA checksum

== Completion ==

W  -> BE : Complete (OVA path, checksum, provenance, flag hashes)
BE -> BE : Verify flag hashes
BE --> W  : state=READY

== Status Polling ==

loop while build active
  FE -> BE : GET /api/builds/{id}
  BE --> FE : current state
end
FE --> U : READY — download + flag submission

@enduml
